  "heading": "Limit of certain deductions.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 94,
  "text": "The total deductions from the pay and allowances of a person made under clauses (e), (g) to (i) of section 91 shall not, except where he is sentenced to dismissal, exceed in any one month one-half of his pay and allowances for that month.",
